   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Sizes and the use of «te»",
     "texto": [
      "To ask about size, say «Welke maat zoek je?» (What size are you looking for?). The verb to try on clothes is «passen»: «Wil je deze broek passen?» (Do you want to try on these trousers?). When an item does not fit well, use «te» (too): «hij is te klein» (it is too small) or «hij is te groot» (it is too big). Unlike English, where objects are always «it», Dutch refers to «de» objects with «hij»: «de broek... hij is te klein»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
